---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const lastUpdated = "October 12, 2026";
---

<Layout
    title="Privacy Policy — ToolsVibe"
    description="Read the ToolsVibe privacy policy to learn how we handle data, cookies, and advertising."
>
    <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-8">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

        <section class="space-y-6 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
            <p>
                At ToolsVibe, accessible from <a
                    href="https://toolsvibe.online/"
                    class="text-blue-600 hover:underline"
                    >https://toolsvibe.online</a
                >, the privacy of our visitors is one of our main priorities.
                This Privacy Policy explains what information we collect, how we
                use it, and your rights regarding your data.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-3">
                1. Information We Collect
            </h2>
            <p>
                Our tools run entirely in your browser. Text, JSON data, and QR
                code content you enter are <strong
                    >never sent to our servers</strong
                > and never stored by us.
            </p>
            <p>
                Like most websites, we may collect non-personal information
                automatically, such as browser type, device type, pages visited,
                and time spent on the site. This data is used only to improve
                our service.
            </p>
            <p>
                We do not collect personal information such as names, email
                addresses, or phone numbers unless you voluntarily provide them
                (for example, through our contact form).
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-3">
                2. Cookies and Web Beacons
            </h2>
            <p>
                ToolsVibe uses cookies to store information about visitor
                preferences and to record which pages the visitor accessed. You
                can disable cookies through your browser settings at any time.
                However, disabling cookies may affect your experience on our
                website.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-3">
                3. Google AdSense and Third-Party Advertising
            </h2>
            <p>
                We may use third-party advertising companies, including <strong
                    >Google AdSense</strong
                >, to serve ads when you visit our website. These companies may
                use information about your visits to this and other websites to
                provide advertisements about goods and services that may
                interest you.
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
                <li>
                    Google, as a third-party vendor, uses cookies (including the <strong
                        >DART cookie</strong
                    >) to serve ads based on your visits to this site and other
                    sites on the internet.
                </li>
                <li>
                    Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its
                    partners to serve ads to you based on your visit to our site
                    and/or other sites on the internet.
                </li>
                <li>
                    You may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting{" "}
                    <a
                        href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads"
                        class="text-blue-600 hover:underline"
                        target="_blank"
                        rel="noopener"
                    >
                        Google Ads Settings
                    </a>.
                </li>
                <li>
                    You can also opt out of some third-party vendors' use of
                    cookies for personalized advertising by visiting{" "}
                    <a
                        href="https://www.aboutads.info"
                        class="text-blue-600 hover:underline"
                        target="_blank"
                        rel="noopener"
                    >
                        aboutads.info
                    </a>.
                </li>
            </ul>
            <p>
                We may also work with other third-party ad networks. You can
                find a list of these networks and their privacy policies through
                the resources mentioned above.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-3">
                4. Third-Party Privacy Policies
            </h2>
            <p>
                Our Privacy Policy does not apply to other advertisers or
                websites. We advise you to consult the respective privacy
                policies of any third-party ad servers for more detailed
                information.
            </p>
            <p>
                These third-party ad servers may have their own policies
                regarding how to opt out of certain options. You can find a
                complete list of these policies and their links at{" "}
                <a
                    href="https://www.aboutads.info"
                    class="text-blue-600 hover:underline"
                    target="_blank"
                    rel="noopener"
                >
                    aboutads.info
                </a>.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-3">
                5. Your Data Protection Rights (GDPR & CCPA)
            </h2>
            <p>
                If you are a resident of the European Economic Area (EEA), you
                have certain data protection rights under the <strong
                    >General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR)</strong
                >. If you are a California resident, you have rights under the{
                    " "
                }
                <strong>California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA)</strong>.
            </p>
            <p>These rights include:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
                <li>
                    <strong>The right to access:</strong> You can request copies of
                    your personal data.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>The right to rectification:</strong> You can request that
                    we correct any information you believe is inaccurate.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>The right to erasure:</strong> You can request that we
                    erase your personal data, under certain conditions.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>The right to restrict processing:</strong> You can request
                    that we restrict the processing of your personal data, under certain
                    conditions.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>The right to object to processing:</strong> You can object
                    to our processing of your personal data, under certain conditions.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>The right to data portability:</strong> You can request
                    that we transfer the data we have collected to another organization,
                    or directly to you, under certain conditions.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>The right to opt out:</strong> California residents have
                    the right to opt out of the sale or sharing of their personal
                    information.
                </li>
            </ul>
            <p>
                If you make a request, we have one month to respond to you. If
                you would like to exercise any of these rights, please contact
                us through our{" "}
                <a href="/contact/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline"
                    >contact page</a
                >.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-3">6. Cookies Consent</h2>
            <p>
                By using our website, you consent to our use of cookies as
                described in this Privacy Policy. You can withdraw your consent
                at any time by clearing cookies from your browser or adjusting
                your browser settings.
            </p>
            <p>
                If you are located in the European Economic Area (EEA), we will
                obtain your consent before placing any non-essential cookies on
                your device, in accordance with GDPR requirements.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-3">
                7. Children's Information
            </h2>
            <p>
                ToolsVibe does not knowingly collect any personal identifiable
                information from children under the age of 13. If you believe
                your child provided this kind of information on our website,
                please contact us immediately and we will do our best to
                promptly remove such information from our records.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-3">
                8. Updates to This Policy
            </h2>
            <p>
                We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes
                will be posted on this page with an updated "Last updated" date.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-3">9. Contact Us</h2>
            <p>
                If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please visit
                our{" "}
                <a href="/contact/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline"
                    >contact page</a
                >.
            </p>
        </section>
    </article>
    <!-- Structured Data for SEO -->
    <script
        type="application/ld+json"
        set:html={JSON.stringify({
            "@context": "https://schema.org",
            "@type": "WebPage",
            name: "Privacy Policy — ToolsVibe",
            url: "https://toolsvibe.online/privacy/",
            description:
                "Read the ToolsVibe privacy policy to learn how we handle data, cookies, and advertising.",
            isPartOf: {
                "@type": "WebSite",
                name: "ToolsVibe",
                url: "https://toolsvibe.online/",
            },
            dateModified: "2026-10-12",
        })}
    />
</Layout>
